      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:7:2:27:3",
      "text": [
        " رَجُلٍ تُوُفِّيَ وَ تَرَكَ امْرَأَتَهُ فَقَالَ لِلْمَرْأَةِ الرُّبُعُ وَ مَا بَقِيَ فَلِلْإِمَامِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Humeyd Bin Ziyad, from Al Hassan Bin Muhammad, from Wuheyb Bin Hafs, from Abu Baseer, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Ja’far<sup>asws</sup> regarding a man who passed away and left his wife. So he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘For the woman is the one-quarter, and whatever remains, so it is for the Imam<sup>asws</sup>’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "3. Humayd ibn Ziyad has narrated from al-Hassan ibn Muhammad from Wuhayb ibn Hafs from abu Basir who has narrated the following: “About the case of a woman who dies and leaves behind her husband, abu Ja‘far, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘One-fourth belongs to the woman and the rest belongs to the Imam.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
